; Regression test for issue #1987
; --flat lists each account with its own amount, not its family total.
;
; In the flat view every account has a line of its own, but an account that
; held postings of its own as well as sub-accounts used to be shown with the
; total of its whole family.  The sub-accounts' amounts were then counted
; twice, the lines of the report did not add up to the total beneath them,
; and "bal Assets:Sub1 --flat" disagreed with "bal Assets:Sub1$ --flat" about
; Assets:Sub1.  An account whose sub-accounts are all hidden, for example by
; --depth, still shows its family total (issue #1020).

2020-01-08 * Test
    Assets:Current:Foo  10.00 EUR
    Assets:Foo

2020-01-08 * Test
    Assets:Current:Bar  10.00 EUR
    Assets:Foo

2020-01-08 * Test
    Assets:Sub1:Sub2   10.00 EUR
    Assets:Sub1        -5.00 EUR
    Assets:Foo

2020-01-08 * Test
    Assets:Sub1:Sub3   10.00 EUR
    Assets:Sub1        -5.00 EUR
    Assets:Foo

2020-01-08 * Test
    Assets:Multi:Sub2   10.00 EUR
    Assets:Multi        -5.00 EUR
    Assets:Foo

2020-01-08 * Test
    Assets:Multi:Sub3   10.00 GBP
    Assets:Multi        -5.00 GBP
    Assets:Foo

; A parent without postings of its own is not listed at all.
test bal Assets:Current --flat
           10.00 EUR  Assets:Current:Bar
           10.00 EUR  Assets:Current:Foo
--------------------
           20.00 EUR
end test

; A parent with postings of its own shows the same amount whether or not its
; sub-accounts are part of the report.
test bal Assets:Sub1$ --flat
          -10.00 EUR  Assets:Sub1
end test

test bal Assets:Sub1 --flat
          -10.00 EUR  Assets:Sub1
           10.00 EUR  Assets:Sub1:Sub2
           10.00 EUR  Assets:Sub1:Sub3
--------------------
           10.00 EUR
end test

; The tree view still shows the family total for the parent.
test bal Assets:Sub1
           10.00 EUR  Assets:Sub1
           10.00 EUR    Sub2
           10.00 EUR    Sub3
--------------------
           10.00 EUR
end test

; The case from the original report, with two commodities.
test bal Assets:Multi --flat
           -5.00 EUR
           -5.00 GBP  Assets:Multi
           10.00 EUR  Assets:Multi:Sub2
           10.00 GBP  Assets:Multi:Sub3
--------------------
            5.00 EUR
            5.00 GBP
end test

; The lines of a flat report add up to its total.
test bal --flat
           10.00 EUR  Assets:Current:Bar
           10.00 EUR  Assets:Current:Foo
          -35.00 EUR
           -5.00 GBP  Assets:Foo
           -5.00 EUR
           -5.00 GBP  Assets:Multi
           10.00 EUR  Assets:Multi:Sub2
           10.00 GBP  Assets:Multi:Sub3
          -10.00 EUR  Assets:Sub1
           10.00 EUR  Assets:Sub1:Sub2
           10.00 EUR  Assets:Sub1:Sub3
--------------------
                   0
end test

; When --depth hides every sub-account, the parent shows the family total,
; whether or not it has postings of its own.
test bal --flat --depth 2
           20.00 EUR  Assets:Current
          -35.00 EUR
           -5.00 GBP  Assets:Foo
            5.00 EUR
            5.00 GBP  Assets:Multi
           10.00 EUR  Assets:Sub1
--------------------
                   0
end test
